# Public build-time settings: configure before rebuilding the frontend.
# Put your real hCaptcha SITE key here; keep its SECRET only in Supabase Auth.
NEXT_PUBLIC_HCAPTCHA_SITE_KEY=
# With no site key, true blocks password forms rather than silently bypassing.
NEXT_PUBLIC_AUTH_CAPTCHA_REQUIRED=true
# Do not enable the provider's CAPTCHA switch until compatible clients are deployed.
